<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD RESULT.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result on the final day of a four-day match Sheffield Shield match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In Adelaide: Tasmania beat South Australia by 10 wickets. Tasmania 425 (Jamie Cox 94, Dene Hills 59, Daniel Marsh 58, Mark Atkinson 58) and 11 for no wicket. South Australia 293 (Darren Lehmann 76, Jamie Siddons 55, Brad Young 56 not out) and 142 (Shaun Young five for 26).</p>
